# HadalOS live packages.
#
# Copy to /etc/portage/package.accept_keywords/hadalos (a file, in the
# directory form — Portage accepts either, and the directory form is what lets
# this be dropped in and removed as a unit).
#
# These carry KEYWORDS="" rather than ~amd64, which is not an oversight. A
# keyworded live ebuild gets pulled in by ordinary dependency resolution and
# rebuilt from a moving target without anyone asking for it. Empty keywords
# mean a live package is installed only because someone named it, and `**` is
# how that opt-in is spelled — it is the one accept_keywords value that matches
# a package with no keywords at all, so ~amd64 here would do nothing.
#
# The consequence to know about: `emerge -uDN @world` will happily rebuild all
# of these from whatever is committed at that moment. That is the intended
# behaviour of a live ebuild and the reason these are separated from the
# versioned packages below.

# The compositor and its shell.
gui-wm/cusk **
gui-apps/cusk-dock **
gui-apps/cusk-launcher **
gui-apps/cusk-settings **

# The assistant.
sys-apps/hadal-brokerd **
sys-apps/hadald **

# The versioned HadalOS packages are ~amd64 and need the usual accept, if the
# system is not already accepting ~amd64 globally.
sys-apps/hadalos-release ~amd64
sys-boot/hadalos-limine-hook ~amd64
app-admin/hadalos-portage-hook ~amd64
acct-user/hadal ~amd64
acct-group/hadal ~amd64

# The kernel. Deliberately NOT pulled in by any metapackage: this laptop boots
# gentoo-kernel-bin through the HadalOS Limine layout, and switching it to
# mainline-tip is a decision about this machine's kernel, not part of becoming
# HadalOS. sys-kernel/hadalos-kernel has never been built — see the README's
# status table — so accepting it here makes it installable on purpose and
# nothing more.
sys-kernel/hadalos-kernel ~amd64
sys-kernel/hadalos-kernel **

# The metapackages. hadalos-desktop, hadalos-assistant and hadalos pull in live
# packages, so they carry empty keywords too rather than implying a stability
# their dependencies do not have.
app-misc/hadalos-base ~amd64
app-misc/hadalos-desktop **
app-misc/hadalos-assistant **
app-misc/hadalos **
